        <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://DreamWeave-MP.github.io/S3ctors-S3cret-St4sh/flextag/"/>
        <id>https://DreamWeave-MP.github.io/S3ctors-S3cret-St4sh/flextag/</id>
        
        <summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;FlexTag is a lightweight, zero-overhead tagging framework for Morrowind on OpenMW. It lets mods ask questions like &quot;is this cell a dungeon?&quot; or &quot;does this NPC belong to the Camonna Tong?&quot; — without hardcoding IDs or guessing.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nothing happens in-game just by installing FlexTag. It&#x27;s a dependency. Other mods use it.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;built-in-tags&quot;&gt;Built-In Tags&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FlexTag ships with six tag datasets covering the vanilla game and its DLCs:&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;</summary>
        
    </entry>
