        <summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;Well, by now the jig is up.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This mod is a small extension for AFFA&#x27;s mod, &lt;a rel=&quot;external&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.nexusmods.com&#x2F;morrowind&#x2F;mods&#x2F;52751&quot;&gt;Fargoth Says Hello&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;</summary>
        
