        <id>https://DreamWeave-MP.github.io/S3ctors-S3cret-St4sh/luamics/</id>
        
        <summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;Luamics is a simple global script that adds a chance for any chest encountered in-game to be replaced by a mimic chest. Mimic chests will retain their original loot, and spawn at a rate of 5%. Chests which are scripted, owned, or have &lt;code&gt;trader&lt;&#x2F;code&gt; in their record id are ineligible to be converted to mimics, so the script &lt;em&gt;should&lt;&#x2F;em&gt; be relatively safe. Should be, that is.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;</summary>
        
    </entry>
