&lt;p&gt;Crassified Navigation is a simple mod, but meant to be as cursed as possible. It&#x27;s effectively an OpenMW port of the mod &lt;code&gt;Get Lost&lt;&#x2F;code&gt;, spawned by a user request in MMC. But it comes with an extra cursed twist, being that as much of the operative Lua code as possible is embedded directly into the mod&#x27;s omwaddon.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
